        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="note" value="The builder renders nothing, uses no network and&lt;br&gt;calls no model. It never makes up a verification&lt;br&gt;run. When the scan cannot pin to head or the base&lt;br&gt;graph cannot be compared, the envelope says&lt;br&gt;incomplete or incompatible and gives the reason." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1a1a1a;" vertex="1" parent="1">
